<Base title="About — muratLola" description="Murat Ogur (muratLola) — visual communication designer and art director. Football kit design, brand identity, art direction.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:12rem;padding-bottom:4rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow"><i></i><span>About</span></div>
    <h1 class="statement" data-reveal>
      I bring a <em>strategic</em> language to sport.
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section about" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="about__frame" data-reveal>
      <img src="/img/murat-ogur.jpg" alt="Murat Ogur — muratLola" />
    </div>
    <div class="about__body" data-reveal>
      <p>I am a visual communication designer and art director. I make football kits, brand identities and visual strategy for clubs and brands.</p>
      <p>Every project starts from a story. A kit's colour is not a preference, it is a decision; if the cut, the texture and the typography do not carry that decision, they are decoration. I find the story first, and the design comes out of it.</p>
      <p>I run the whole process: concept and research, design, 3D modelling and cloth simulation in CLO3D, rendering and presentation frames.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/en/services"><span>How I work</span><i>→</i></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
